                <a id="corresp-c1" aria-label="email Chuanhua Feng" href="mailto:ndyfy09692@ncu.edu.cn">Chuanhua Feng</a> or <a id="corresp-c2" aria-label="email Jian Zhou" href="mailto:369271341@qq.com">Jian Zhou</a>.</p></div></div></section><section data-title="Ethics declarations"><div class="c-article-section" id="ethics-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="ethics">Ethics declarations</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="ethics-content">
              
              
                <h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="FPar1">Declaration of AI Use</h3>
                <p>No AI or generative AI tools were used in the manuscript writing, data processing, chart drawing and revision. All contents of this manuscript were independently finished by the authors.</p>
              
              
                <h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="FPar2">Competing interest</h3>
                <p>The authors declare that they have no known competing financial interests or personal relationships that could have appeared to influence the work reported in this paper.</p>
              
            </div></div></section><section data-title="Additional information"><div class="c-article-section" id="additional-information-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="additional-information">Additional information</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="additional-information-content"><h3 class="c-article__sub-heading">Publisher's Note</h3><p>Springer Nature remains neutral with regard to jurisdictional claims in published maps and institutional affiliations.</p></div></div></section><section data-title="Rights and permissions"><div class="c-article-section" id="rightslink-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="rightslink">Rights and permissions</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="rightslink-content"><p>Springer Nature or its licensor (e.g. a society or other partner) holds exclusive rights to this article under a publishing agreement with the author(s) or other rightsholder(s); author self-archiving of the accepted manuscript version of this article is solely governed by the terms of such publishing agreement and applicable law.</p><p class="c-article-rights"><a data-track="click" data-track-action="view rights and permissions" data-track-label="link" href="https://s100.copyright.com/AppDispatchServlet?title=Drying%20Characteristics%20and%20Quality%20Evaluation%20of%20Hawthorn%20Using%20Ultrasonic%20Integrated%20Hot%20Air%20Drying%20Technology&amp;author=Chuanhua%20Feng%20et%20al&amp;contentID=10.1007%2Fs11947-026-04589-3&amp;copyright=The%20Author%28s%29%2C%20under%20exclusive%20licence%20to%20Springer%20Science%2BBusiness%20Media%2C%20LLC%2C%20part%20of%20Springer%20Nature&amp;publication=1935-5130&amp;publicationDate=2026-09-16&amp;publisherName=SpringerNature&amp;orderBeanReset=true">Reprints and permissions</a></p></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="article-info" data-title="About this articl